      "content": "SP 91 SW               MARSWORTH          LOWER END 6/110                                     Greystones 6.4.70 GV                                        II House.  C17, altered.  2 centre bays have timber frame and whitewashed brick infill.  Thatched roof, half-hipped over whitewashed weatherboard garage bay to right.  Whitewashed brick extensions to left, of one bay with lean-to, have tiled roofs and flanking brick chimneys. 1½ storeys, 4 bays.  Centre bays have wooden casements, 2-light to ground floor right and in half-hipped eaves-line dormers,  3-light to ground floor left.  Windows to right are C20.  Central C20 door, small board door in weatherboarded bay.  Left bay has C20 casements and french doors. Listing NGR: SP9193314824"
    }
  ],
